  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵First, create a 5000x5000 pixel height map, where each pixel corresponds to 1 meter in Minecraft.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Considering that Hong Kong spans approximately 50,000 meters (50 km) from south to north, the resulting scale of the Minecraft map would be 1:10.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, in Minecraft, due to visibility limitations, the terrain doesn't quite resemble the actual Hong Kong landscape.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "To get a better view, you'd need to use a map viewer that allows you to see farther.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's the effect:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "While the mountainous terrain on Hong Kong Island is somewhat recognizable, the height map’s handling of flat areas isn’t ideal—it needs some smoothing.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, let’s consider the next steps: Is it worthwhile to achieve a 1:1, 1:2, or 1:5 scale?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Going 1:1 would be quite a trek, and a larger scale might make the streets look odd.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So, it’s a balancing act!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "minecraft-hong-kong-map",
        "title": "Minecraft Map for Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/minecraft-hong-kong-map/"
      }
    },
